{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40098","label":"ARK GUARDIAN · Part 1"},"label":"The Real Enemy: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_arkguardian2_01_e","next":"event_arkguardian2_02_e","speakers":{"commander":"Commander","VTCPriestess":"V.T.C. Priestess"},"icons":{"commander":"si_c942_00_s","VTCPriestess":"si_c9016_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_1","text":"Vapaus?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Church","bgArt":"church","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_wm_forest","movie":null,"shown":["commander","VTCPriestess"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_2","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_3","text":"It's a unique substance that can be extracted from your blood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_4","text":"What is it exactly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_5","text":"To put it simply, it is a substance that kills nanomachines,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_6","text":"including the NIMPH within a Nikke's brain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_7","text":"It can also disintegrate the physical body of a Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_8","text":"A Heretic...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_9","text":"Yes. Not long ago, five Heretics attacked the Ark entrance. The Goddess Squad wiped them all out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_10","text":"One of them was exposed to the Vapaus within you, which caused the collapse of her nanomachines and the loss of her regenerative abilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_11","text":"She was ultimately eliminated by the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_12","text":"Additionally, when we administered it to the captured Heretic, Anachiro, it was confirmed the Vapaus in your blood is genuine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_13","text":"While there were minor complications, it's nothing to be concerned about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_14","text":"We've assigned Hellhound to the matter. It should be resolved soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_15","text":"So you're telling me that Heretic disintegrated... because of my blood?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_16","text":"That's correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_17","text":"Well, she did stab me in the guts. Maybe it wasn't my blood that did it, but my fecal matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_19","text":"... Not your type of humor. Noted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_20","text":"Much appreciated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_21","text":"So, how is any of this even possible?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_22","text":"Why is there such a substance in my blood, and why is it lethal to the Heretics?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_24","text":"I can only disclose that it's part of a long-forgotten project known as Mechanical Messiah,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_25","text":"the details of which I cannot share, even to you, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_26","text":"Heh. Classified. Figures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_27","text":"I couldn't care less what you're up to at the V.T.C.,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_28","text":"but keep doing your dirty work in the shadows, and one day it'll catch up with you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_29","text":"Do you really think that'll happen?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_30","text":"Right now, you can act as if you're untouchable, since this is your world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_31","text":"But the second things backfire and the consequences of your filthy actions start affecting us,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_32","text":"prepare for the church to close its doors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_33","text":"I shall bear that in mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_34","text":"It's not every day you get to chat with a V.T.C. priestess, so let me ask you something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_35","text":"The Ark...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_36","text":"It wasn't built after the Rapture invasion, was it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_37","text":"Why do you think so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_38","text":"Because it's rather strange if you ask me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_39","text":"I took a little field trip down to the Ark once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_40","text":"You're telling me that massive, advanced underground city was constructed in just a few years?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_41","text":"It was not even mid-construction. It was basically finished.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_42","text":"You're seriously underestimating humanity's technological prowess.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_43","text":"We've even come close to the realm of the divine before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_44","text":"That's ridiculous. Just excavating all that dirt alone would have taken a decade.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_45","text":"After thinking it through, I've got two theories:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_46","text":"Either you've got tech that defies belief,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_47","text":"or you predicted the Rapture invasion a long time ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_48","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_49","text":"Seems one of the two theories hold truth after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_50","text":"Your suspicion is nothing more than baseless conjecture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_51","text":"Naturally, since you didn't leave behind any evidence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_52","text":"Oh, just to be clear,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_53","text":"this is pure curiosity on my part.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_54","text":"I've no intentions of stirring up trouble, so chill.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_55","text":"Appreciate the thought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_56","text":"Anyway, how's my physical body?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_57","text":"We had to remove a significant portion of your internal organs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_58","text":"You might not be able to live an ordinary life from now on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_59","text":"Any strenuous movements will undoubtedly have a big impact on your daily life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_60","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_61","text":"If there's any time I could use one of your so-called \"miracles,\" now would be it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_62","text":"The only reason you have made it this far is because of a miracle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_63","text":"Otherwise, you would already be dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_64","text":"I'm pretty sturdy, you know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_65","text":"Yes, I am aware. That is precisely why you can still stand and speak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_66","text":"An ordinary human would have been bedridden and on life support for the rest of their days.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_67","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_68","text":"Well, thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_69","text":"Think nothing of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_70","text":"I should get going.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_71","text":"My poor subordinates must be wearing a hole in the floor, waiting for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_72","text":"Thanks a bunch. I owe you one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"VTCPriestess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_73","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_74","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_74","text":"The Commander leaves the room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian2_02_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian2_02_s_75","text":"Next time someone leaves, at least say goodbye. I swear, you V.T.C. weirdos are so 